#: quicklaunch.cpp:156
msgid "Max row count:"
msgstr "ចំនួន​ជួរដេក​អតិបរមា ៖"

#: quicklaunch.cpp:165
msgid "Force column settings:"
msgstr "បង្ខំ​ការ​កំណត់​ជួរឈរ ៖"

